    "name": "Goblin Gladiators",
    "steam_appid": 1944710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/b957f87d6cbe1a32a2f7a7cc744e99f5.avif?t=1695998867\" /></div><br>Live fast, die ridiculously! The big brawl has begun, and you are invited to unleash chaos in the most thrilling battle arena ever seen through the eyes of goblins. Welcome to Goblin Gladiators, where danger lurks in every corner, fearsome foes await, and a deadly fog draws near. Will your pack of cunning goblin fighters rise to the top and claim victory in this heart-pounding spectacle? It's time to find out! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/046d4729e98ac4629617af448f6e574c.poster.avif?t=1695998867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/046d4729e98ac4629617af448f6e574c.webm?t=1695998867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/d9fe798be0176c60643a6580630cd2cb.avif?t=1695998867\" /></div><br>Choose from three distinct character types - Sagittarius the archer, Secutor the warrior, and Dimachaerus the assassin. Each goblin possesses their own set of unique skills and abilities to match your play style. Level up and customize your warriors to dominate the arena! Every swing of your blade or crackle of arcane power can change the tide of battle - it's all up to you, you cunning Goblin!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5a0b4f893ab20d855706e8b220eb878b.poster.avif?t=1695998867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5a0b4f893ab20d855706e8b220eb878b.webm?t=1695998867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/a8055dd045e5d5e37f1722aa4614932b.avif?t=1695998867\" /></div><br>The battle arena is fraught with peril as you face off against other teams of goblin gladiators and the intervention of hordes of nibblers and mythical opponents that can throw off your winning streak at any moment. Join forces with friends and challenge rival gobbo gladiators in exhilarating multiplayer battles. Only the smartest and most agile goblins will emerge victorious.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5895d9f215f7ed30cb75932bf61c5c47.poster.avif?t=1695998867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5895d9f215f7ed30cb75932bf61c5c47.webm?t=1695998867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/d44bcff31763bcc66c3cae1819375705.avif?t=1695998867\" /></div><br>In Goblin Gladiators, death is just the beginning of the fun. You can equip devestating death effects that give you immediate revenge on your enemies. Even when your goblins fall, you still get to make a real impact on the gameplay. Choose to aid or sabotage other players, or return as a charging nibbler boomer, seeking revenge on your adversaries. The choices are limitless!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/541462687014345424257853bb948bc8.poster.avif?t=1695998867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/541462687014345424257853bb948bc8.webm?t=1695998867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
