ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5a0b4f893ab20d855706e8b220eb878b.webm?t=1695998867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/a8055dd045e5d5e37f1722aa4614932b.avif?t=1695998867\" /></div><br>The battle arena is fraught with peril as you face off against other teams of goblin gladiators and the intervention of hordes of nibblers and mythical opponents that can throw off your winning streak at any moment. Join forces with friends and challenge rival gobbo gladiators in exhilarating multiplayer battles. Only the smartest and most agile goblins will emerge victorious.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5895d9f215f7ed30cb75932bf61c5c47.poster.avif?t=1695998867\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/5895d9f215f7ed30cb75932bf61c5c47.webm?t=1695998867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/d44bcff31763bcc66c3cae1819375705.avif?t=1695998867\" /></div><br>In Goblin Gladiators, death is just the beginning of the fun. You can equip devestating death effects that give you immediate revenge on your enemies. Even when your goblins fall, you still get to make a real impact on the gameplay. Choose to aid or sabotage other players, or return as a charging nibbler boomer, seeking revenge on your adversaries. The choices are limitless!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944710/extras/54